game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2282410/extras/1aea716e2d9e5903c48cadca7be90c99.poster.avif?t=1738001809\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2282410/extras/1aea716e2d9e5903c48cadca7be90c99.webm?t=1738001809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2282410/extras/1aea716e2d9e5903c48cadca7be90c99.mp4?t=1738001809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Us on Discord:\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
